<urn:beads-cache:finding:C2-FTQ-008> triage:qa6Review "{\"owner\": \"background C2 rust-developer, with upstream public compatibility restoration owned by sc-runtime\", \"qa_pass\": \"qa-6\", \"reviewed_commit\": \"08f7cee0308f52eb0a5a0067cb4e209e2c82806e\", \"reviewer_records\": [{\"finding\": {\"evidence\": \"observability_start.rs105-143 is an unwrapped #[test];123-129 constructs the real daemon command and waits in output() without a timeout, watchdog or Child guard. The named flaky-test-qa role explicitly covers \\\"any wait, read, join, or poll with no hard deadline\\\" and requires finite failure cleanup. In contrast observability_adapter_tests.rs133-199 and service/test_support.rs17-69 supervise owned fixture children with a single10s deadline. Workflow45minute job cancellation is not a local test supervisor. This is a static missing-failure-bound finding, not an observed startup failure.\", \"file\": \"crates/bd-cache-daemon/tests/observability_start.rs\", \"id\": \"C2-FTQ-008\", \"issue\": \"This ordinary integration test calls Command::output directly and has no owned-child supervisor or hard deadline. If daemon startup/logger handling stalls instead of returning the expected error, output waits for child termination and pipe EOF indefinitely, so none of the expected exit/stderr assertions run and no timeout path kills or reaps the child. Unlike the service/logger scenarios, this test is not inside bounded_fixture. No actual current hang is alleged.\", \"line\": 123, \"mechanism\": \"unbounded_wait\", \"recommendation\": \"Use a minimal owned-child supervisor with the existing project process-test bound, bounded output collection and kill/reap on expiration and assertion unwind. Retain the exact expected stderr, empty stdout, exit1, secret exclusion and unopened-instance assertions. Do not introduce a new general framework or extend existing budgets.\", \"severity\": \"important\", \"status\": \"open_new_unbounded_process_wait\", \"test\": \"process_formats_real_init_failure_once_without_values_or_stdout\"}, \"reviewer\": \"flaky-test-qa\"}], \"scope\": \"Preserve occurrence-specific source corrections and actual platform limits; final sole-enforcer report pending publication.\", \"screen\": \"all_not_applicable; no waiver or suppression\", \"severity\": \"Important\", \"status\": \"open\"}" .

